  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Change Object Data\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. In `script.js`, look at the `snacks` array.\r\n\r\n2. Use AI Tutor to render each snack as a card on the page.\r\n   Each card should display:\r\n     - image\r\n     - name\r\n     - flavor\r\n     - price\r\n\r\n3. Review the code and update the data:\r\n   - Change the **name** of one snack\r\n   - Change the **flavor** of another\r\n   - Change the **price** of another\r\n\r\n5. Run the app again.\r\n\r\n### Check Your Code:\r\n\r\n- Did the cards update when you changed the object values?\r\n- Which property controls the image?\r\n- Which property controls the name?\r\n- Where is `.map()` repeating the same rule for each snack?",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
